@dc:title "Waterline Construction Vocabulary Bundle"
@dc:description "A bundle that includes the vocabularies used for the Waterline Construction project."

vocabulary bundle <https://waterline.project/waterline-construction/vocabulary-bundle#> as v-bundle {

    includes <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    includes <https://www.modelware.io/sierra/base#>
    includes <https://www.modelware.io/sierra/component#>
    includes <https://www.modelware.io/sierra/process#>
    includes <https://www.modelware.io/sierra/stakeholder#>
    includes <https://waterline.project/waterline-construction/waterline#>
}